  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Dark sphere, evil alignment.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Any good creature that begins their turn within or enters the area of effect of your darkness must succeed at a Fortitude save against its DC or be sickened for one minute, even if normally immune to being sickened or effects requiring a Fortitude save. A creature that succeeds on its saving throw is immune to your Damning Darkness for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dark#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
